Mike Forbes answers:
mf> 	1) A kitchen sink is useful for identifying rings.  just stand on the
mf> 	   sink and drop the ring.  it's even better when you have 2 or more
mf> 	   of the same ring.
mf> 
mf> 	2)  Couldn't tell ya.

1) In NetHack 3.0, you can also drink ('q') from sinks.  Please mention what
   version you're playing (use the 'v' command to find out) next time.

2) Leash?  A leash is a strap or chain with a wrist loop, which one attaches
   to an animal's collar so it cannot wander far from you.  Just apply ('a')
   it next to your pet.


